    "https://recruiting.myapps.paychex.com/appone/MainInfoReq.asp?R_ID=6460665&B_ID=91&fid=1&Adid=&SearchScreenID=26243&CountryID=3&LanguageID=2": {
      "title": "Custodian (Full-Time)",
      "description": "Job Information: Custodian (Full-Time) Job Share Email Opening Apply Now Title Custodian (Full-Time) EOE Statement We are an equal employment opportunity employer.  All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to any category protected by applicable federal, state or local law, including but not limited to race, color, religion, sex, national origin, age, physical or mental disability, genetic information, protected veteran status, uniformed service member status or any other characteristic protected by law. About the Organization Saint Vincent College is an educational community rooted in the tradition of the Catholic faith, the heritage of Benedictine monasticism, and the love of values inherent in the liberal approach to life and learning. Our mission is to provide quality undergraduate and graduate education for men and women to enable them to integrate their professional aims with the broader purposes of human life. The programs, activities, and encounters that make up student life at Saint Vincent College encourages the intellectual gifts, professional aptitudes and personal aspirations of students to mature harmoniously. Position Custodian (Full-Time) Location Saint Vincent College Full-Time/Part-Time Full-Time Shift Various Shifts Exempt/Non-Exempt Non-Exempt Description About Saint Vincent College: Founded in 1846, Saint Vincent College is a Benedictine liberal arts and sciences college. When you join our staff, you will become part of the community that supports the next generation of doctors, teachers, engineers, and business professionals by contributing your talents to our institution. We strive to create a welcoming environment where employees are empowered to achieve their professional goals and where collaborative relationships lead to shared success. Responsibilities: As part of the custodial team, you will perform a variety of tasks in one or more campus buildings including general cleaning, floor care, and restocking restrooms. You will report to the custodial supervisor. Requirements: High school diploma or GED. No experience is necessary. Able to work from a ladder for tasks such as changing light bulbs, cleaning windows, and dusting hard-to-reach areas. Able to lift, pull, and push objects weighing up to 50 pounds. Successful completion of background checks and clearances. Benefits and Perks: Saint Vincent College offers a wide range of employee benefits. As a full-time employee, Medical, dental, and vision plans 403 (b) retirement plan with contribution from the College Life insurance College tuition for yourself and your dependents Employee Assistance Plan Paid time off and paid vacation days Access to our fitness center and pool Complimentary admission to many athletic events and arts performances Enterprise rental car discounts We welcome applications from all qualified candidates, including women and minorities. We are dedicated to building a diverse and skilled team.   Saint Vincent College is an equal opportunity employer, committed to providing a fair and inclusive workplace. Tags position, shift, city, state This position is currently accepting applications. Apply Now WE ALSO RECOMMEND Other Jobs Within Same Category Grounds Crew Member in Latrobe, PA Posted on: 10/5/2026 [Apply Now] Custodian (Part-Time) in Latrobe, PA Posted on: 2/9/2026 [Apply Now] Other Jobs Within 60 Miles Administrative Human Resource Associate in Latrobe, PA Posted on: 8/31/2026 [Apply Now] Head Coach: Women’s Rugby in Latrobe, PA Posted on: 7/24/2026 [Apply Now] Head Coach: Men's Rugby in Latrobe, PA Posted on: 7/24/2026 [Apply Now] Accounting Assistant in Latrobe, PA Posted on: 8/10/2026 [Apply Now] Accounting & Finance Manager in Latrobe, PA Posted on: 8/10/2026 [Apply Now] Follow us See who works here: App One .com TM ©1999-2024 HR Services, Inc. Click here for technical assistance. We use cookies and other technologies to support site functionality, analytics,